# DESIGN.md maintenance

Whenever a new design, architectural, or UX decision is made (e.g. new feature approach, API change, install strategy, visual guideline), update `DESIGN.md` with:

- A concise heading under the appropriate section
- The decision and its rationale
- Any trade-offs or alternatives considered

Do this in the same commit as the implementation change. Never defer the DESIGN.md update to a follow-up.
